  "title": "Two Armies Cross the Mountains",
  "year": "263",
  "summary": [
    "Zhong Hui comes down the main road with a hundred thousand men and Deng Ai holds Jiang Wei in the west so he cannot get back. Hanzhong falls in weeks — the outer forts had been reorganised, on Jiang Wei's own advice, into a scheme that depended on a mobile field army that no longer existed.",
    "Jiang Wei extracts himself by a forced march and gets to Jiange in time to shut the gate. Zhong Hui's hundred thousand stop dead in front of it."
